         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">These transistors are designed for general purpose amplifier&#xA;applications. They are housed in the SC-70/SOT-323 which is&#xA;designed for low power surface mount applications.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
